OL,5,G2300 Galapagos
OL,6,     F4/5. Bryony is still happy to spin
OL,7,     Fthe narrative about the role of
OL,8,     Fthe Galapagos AI in Karikoga's
OL,9,     Fdeath. But she's about to realise
OL,10,     Fthat Galapagos' influence is now
OL,11,     Fmuch closer to home.
